# Architecture

Follow [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md) and ADRs in [docs/decisions/](docs/decisions/).

| Layer | Path | Role |
|-------|------|------|
| App | `src/` | Next.js App Router, `@/*` → `src/*` |
| Product DS | `design/` | App-shell foundations, tokens, themes |
| Visual styles | `content/styles/<id>/` | `style.json`, `tokens.json`, prompts RU+EN, MD |
| Page templates | `content/templates/<id>/` | Structure + RU demo copy (R1+) |
| Specs | `docs/` | English technical contracts |

**Pipeline:** Template + Style → Renderer → Preview → Prompt / Export ([ADR-0009](docs/decisions/ADR-0009-template-style-preview-prompt.md)).

**Forbidden without ADR:** DB, CMS, GraphQL, microservices, separate content repo.

**Export:** token SSOT `content/styles/<id>/tokens.json` ([docs/EXPORT_FORMAT.md](docs/EXPORT_FORMAT.md)); do not hardcode hex/spacing in UI.

**IDs:** kebab-case, language-independent (`swiss-international`).

Before Next.js 16 edits — guides in `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` (see [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md)).
